{pad:meta title='Two ways to write one', about='The widget tag and the widget: type - the same toast each time.'/}
{widget:toast 'A toast', tone='success'}{pad:open/}widget:toast 'A toast'{pad:close/} - the first parameter is the toast's title.{/widget:toast}
{widget:toast 'The widget: type'}{pad:open/}widget:toast 'The widget: type'{pad:close/}{/widget:toast}
